of seven hundred agents

3
00:00:05,242 --> 00:00:06,601
Fifteen months later

4
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:09,526
its CEO said Klarna would invest in human

5
00:00:09,546 --> 00:00:10,524
support again

6
00:00:11,028 --> 00:00:12,317
The results were real

7
00:00:12,337 --> 00:00:14,758
Two point three million chats in the first

8
00:00:14,778 --> 00:00:15,531
month

9
00:00:16,028 --> 00:00:18,963
Errands went from eleven minutes to under two

10
00:00:19,461 --> 00:00:22,849
But in May 2025 the CEO admitted cost had

11
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:23,792
dominated

12
00:00:23,812 --> 00:00:25,266
and what you end up having is lower

13
00:00:25,286 --> 00:00:26,264
